---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import PageLayout from "../layouts/PageLayout.astro";
import { siteConfig } from "../data/site";

const crumbs = [
  { name: "Home", url: "/" },
  { name: "Editorial Policy", url: "/editorial-policy" },
];

const lastUpdated = "2026-08-22";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Editorial Policy"
  description="How {siteConfig.name} produces trustworthy, evergreen, human-reviewed content — from research and fact-checking to corrections and AI disclosure."
>
  <PageLayout title="Editorial Policy" breadcrumbs={crumbs} updatedDate={lastUpdated}>
    <p>Last updated: {lastUpdated}</p>

    <h2>Our purpose</h2>
    <p>
      {siteConfig.name} publishes practical, evergreen information — guides, how-tos,
      troubleshooting help, tips, buying guidance, and plain-English explanations of
      technology. We deliberately do not chase breaking news. Our goal is content that stays
      accurate and useful for years, not articles written for clicks.
    </p>

    <h2>How articles are produced</h2>
    <p>
      Every article follows a fixed workflow before publication:
      <strong>Research → AI draft → Humanize → Fact check → SEO check → Human review → Publish.</strong>
      AI tools assist with research and drafting, but AI is never allowed to publish content on
      its own. A human reviews, edits, and approves everything that appears on this site.
    </p>

    <h2>Accuracy and sourcing</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>We prefer well-established, version-independent advice and clearly state when something depends on a device, software version, or configuration.</li>
      <li>We link to trustworthy sources — official documentation, manufacturers, and reputable organizations — when facts are specific or could change.</li>
      <li>We do not invent statistics, quotes, or experiences. If we cannot verify a claim, we say so.</li>
      <li>Recommendations are based on usefulness and honesty, not on who pays us.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Corrections</h2>
    <p>
      Technology changes quickly and mistakes can happen. When an error is found, we correct it
      and, where appropriate, note the update in the article's “Updated” date. To report an
      error, email <a href={`mailto:${siteConfig.email}`}>{siteConfig.email}</a>.
    </p>

    <h2>AI-assisted content</h2>
    <p>
      We use AI to assist with drafting and research. All AI-assisted content is humanized,
      fact-checked, and edited by people before publication, and we hold it to the same
      standards as fully human-written content. We never publish low-effort or auto-generated
      articles.
    </p>

    <h2>Independence and monetization</h2>
    <p>
      Editorial content is independent of advertisers and affiliate partners. Articles that are
      sponsored or contain affiliate links are always disclosed in the article itself. Affiliate
      relationships never determine what we publish or what we recommend. See the{" "}
      <a href="/disclaimer">Disclaimer</a> for details.
    </p>

    <h2>Evergreen maintenance</h2>
    <p>
      We periodically review published articles to check for outdated advice and refresh them
      when needed. When an article is updated, its “Updated” date changes so readers know the
      information is current.
    </p>
  </PageLayout>
</BaseLayout>
